/// | `LeafText` | [`LeafText<'tree>`](LeafText) | [`SourceSlice<'tree, 'source>`](SourceSlice) |
/// | `LeafSpan` | [`LeafSpan<'tree>`](LeafSpan) | [`ReadableLeafSpan<'tree, 'source>`](ReadableLeafSpan) |
